        <item>
            <title>1.2.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:02:03 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Watermark Intensity is now a real 2D matrix: drag to set size and layout style (Single/Rotated/Tiled/Tiled+Rotated) together, opacity stays independently adjustable and shows live on the drag handle.</li>
                    <li>Discrete is now less opaque, Protective is fully opaque -- both per direct feedback.</li>
                    <li>Single (non-tiled) watermarks can now be rotated, not just tiled ones.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cadavidf/WatermarkFactory/releases/download/v1.2.1/WatermarkFactory.dmg" length="2374067" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ou7IaeEDNXLeCNerTglTJ7oU11dt4/71CvOMSQCNrPMb3c/4mB4PuDWNwXBdslUABb8ARPoBMgKytpchH78gDA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>1.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 10:19:19 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>5</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <ul>
                    <li>Fixed Chat mode: it never actually worked before (10s timeout vs ~28s real model latency meant every message silently fell back to the click-through flow). Now uses gemma3:4b (3-5s/turn), verified live in English and Spanish.</li>
                    <li>Fixed native controls (DisclosureGroup, Picker) showing the Mac's system accent color instead of Automality teal.</li>
                    <li>Added Sparkle auto-update -- this is the first version that can update itself.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cadavidf/WatermarkFactory/releases/download/v1.1.2/WatermarkFactory.dmg" length="2321909" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Gi+iFUTbofWUM0IqidWPIdtN85kq6xjKWImExAkGdW4LDFomr5arCfA8QbnRriJU8Mu5DpB7w6sqeGy6H99TDw=="/>
